%% Modulo 29 - POST /api/v1/qa/defects/{defect}/retests
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor DEV as Responsable del modulo
    actor QA as Analista QA
    participant MW as tenant + JWT + permiso
    participant CTRL as QaRegressionController
    participant APP as ManageQaRegression
    participant REPO as QaRegressionRepository
    participant DB as PostgreSQL HOSPITAL
    participant HIS as HIS bajo prueba

    DEV-->>QA: Comunicar fixed_version
    QA->>HIS: Repetir manualmente el caso corregido
    HIS-->>QA: Resultado observado
    QA->>MW: POST /api/v1/qa/defects/{defect}/retests
    Note right of QA: fixed_version, status, actual_result y evidence
    MW->>MW: Validar tenant, jwt.auth y qa.regression.manage
    MW->>CTRL: Payload validado por RetestDefectRequest
    CTRL->>APP: retest(RetestDefectCommand)
    APP->>APP: Autorizar qa.regression.manage y hospital
    APP->>REPO: findDefect(defect, hospitalId)
    REPO->>DB: SELECT qa_defects por hospital_id
    DB-->>REPO: Defect OPEN, REOPENED o CLOSED
    REPO-->>APP: Defect
    APP->>REPO: findExecution(initialExecutionId, hospitalId)
    REPO->>DB: SELECT ejecucion inicial y evidencia
    DB-->>REPO: TestExecution inicial
    REPO-->>APP: TestExecution
    APP->>APP: Crear nueva TestExecution y Evidence
    APP->>APP: registerRetest(status, fixed_version)

    alt defecto ya CLOSED
        APP-->>CTRL: Conflicto
        CTRL-->>QA: 409 Conflict
    else defecto OPEN o REOPENED
        APP->>REPO: recordRetest(execution, defect)
        REPO->>DB: BEGIN y SELECT defecto FOR UPDATE

        alt defecto cerrado concurrentemente
            REPO->>DB: ROLLBACK
            REPO-->>APP: QaConflictException
            APP-->>CTRL: Conflicto
            CTRL-->>QA: 409 Conflict
        else status es PASSED
            REPO->>DB: INSERT ejecucion y evidencia
            REPO->>DB: UPDATE defecto CLOSED, fixed_version, closed_at
            REPO->>DB: COMMIT
            REPO-->>APP: Re-prueba confirmada
            APP-->>CTRL: execution + defect CLOSED
            CTRL-->>QA: 201 Created
        else status es FAILED o BLOCKED
            REPO->>DB: INSERT ejecucion y evidencia
            REPO->>DB: UPDATE defecto REOPENED, fixed_version, closed_at null
            REPO->>DB: COMMIT
            REPO-->>APP: Re-prueba confirmada
            APP-->>CTRL: execution + defect REOPENED
            CTRL-->>QA: 201 Created
        end
    end

    Note over APP,DB: fixed_version se registra dentro de la re-prueba, no hay endpoint separado
